# Cursor Rules - Xenity Engine
# Refer to AGENT.md for full context.

1. Automatically check `knowledge_base/` before suggesting or writing engine architectural changes.
2. Whenever creating design plans, research, or graphics proposals, automatically save them as markdown files in `knowledge_base/<category>/` using `knowledge_base/templates/ai_document_template.md`.
3. Target Platforms: Linux (native CMake/ELF), Windows, PS3 (256MB VRAM limit), Xbox 360, PS Vita, PSP (fixed-function only).
4. Language Standards: Engine Core is C++17, Editor is Rust 2024 (eframe/wgpu on Vulkan for Linux).
5. Always keep the codebase cross-platform and memory-constrained.
